{"about_the_game":"<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1600320/extras/56c786e1a388b08d34f8a4c21514156e.poster.avif?t=1664190968\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1600320/extras/56c786e1a388b08d34f8a4c21514156e.webm?t=1664190968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1600320/extras/56c786e1a388b08d34f8a4c21514156e.mp4?t=1664190968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Future! In the wake of a cataclysm! You are the prey in a world full of hunters. Run, overpower them and free the violent streets in this intensively fast-paced cyber adventure. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1600320/extras/8e82504fd2d1a123947d9b9f1d99af77.poster.avif?t=1664190968\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1600320/extras/8e82504fd2d1a123947d9b9f1d99af77.webm?t=1664190968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1600320/extras/8e82504fd2d1a123947d9b9f1d99af77.mp4?t=1664190968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Be the decisive last stand in an infinite run gameplay by starting with a simple blade and evolve step by step to unlock more advanced weapons. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1600320/extras/c34d27d26d5dc8a22180e1eb1cf68581.poster.avif?t=1664190968\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1600320/extras/c34d27d26d5dc8a22180e1eb1cf68